---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base title="Prendre rendez-vous — ARB Réunion">
  <Header />
  <main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)]"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- HERO / EN-TÊTE DE PAGE -->
<section class="page-hero hero-photo relative w-full pt-8 pb-16 md:pb-24 overflow-hidden" style="--hero-image: url('/images/bandeaux/cirque.webp')">
<!-- Texture de fond organique -->
<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40 pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply bg-[radial-gradient(#114e4a_0.75px,transparent_0.75px)] [background-size:20px_20px]"></div>
<div class="relative w-full max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-gutter-mobile md:px-gutter lg:px-margin flex flex-col">
<!-- Fil d'Ariane -->
<nav aria-label="Fil d'Ariane" class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">
<a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-1" data-path="accueil" href="/">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">home</span>
<span>Accueil</span>
</a>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-outline-variant">chevron_right</span>
<a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" data-path="accompagnement-projets" href="/accompagnement">Accompagnement &amp; Projets</a>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-outline-variant">chevron_right</span>
<span class="text-primary font-bold">Prendre rendez-vous</span>
</nav>
<!-- Badge de certification service public -->
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 self-start bg-secondary-container/80 text-primary-container px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary">verified</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm tracking-wide uppercase font-semibold">Service Public Gratuit • Accompagnement d'ingénierie écologique péi</span>
</div>
<!-- Titre & Chapeau éditorial -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-12">
<div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[46px] md:leading-[54px] text-primary-container font-extrabold tracking-tight">
            Permanence Conseil &amp; Diagnostics Flash en Ligne
          </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            Échangez pendant 45 minutes avec un écologue, un botaniste ou un ingénieur de l'ARB Réunion pour sécuriser vos projets d'aménagement, décrypter les enjeux réglementaires péi ou mobiliser les leviers financiers de la biodiversité.
          </p>
</div>
<!-- Cartouche repère météo & veille insulaire -->
<div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-3 relative">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-surface-variant">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 animate-pulse"></span>
              Pôles Territoriaux Ouverts
            </span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold text-primary">Semaine en cours</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">calendar_today</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-on-surface">Prochains créneaux sans délai</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Saint-Paul (Cambaie) &amp; Visioconférence</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- 4 Réassurances clés -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-shadow">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">account_balance</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<h2 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface font-bold">100% Neutre &amp; Gratuit</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Financé par Région Réunion, DEAL &amp; Office Français de la Biodiversité.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-shadow">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">hub</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<h2 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface font-bold">Format Hybride Souple</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Présentiel dans nos 4 antennes péi ou visioconférence sécurisée.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-shadow">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed text-tertiary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">flash_on</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<h2 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface font-bold">Confirmation Immédiate</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Rappel par SMS &amp; courriel avec fichier de calendrier direct (.ics).</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-shadow">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">menu_book</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<h2 class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface font-bold">Dossier Pré-qualifié</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Étude préalable de vos pièces par nos experts avant la séance.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- DÉCOUPE VAGUE ORGANIQUE : Transition vers le formulaire clair -->
<div aria-hidden="true" class="w-full text-surface leading-none -mt-1 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden">
<svg class="w-full h-12 md:h-20 fill-current" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 -16 1440 96">
<path d="M0,32 C280,72 440,8 720,44 C1000,80 1200,16 1440,48 L1440,80 L0,80 Z"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<!-- MODULE DE RÉSERVATION MULTI-ÉTAPES (STEPPER INTERACTIF) -->
<section class="w-full bg-surface py-10 md:py-16">
<div class="w-full max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-gutter-mobile md:px-gutter lg:px-margin">
<!-- Stepper visuel -->
<div class="bg-surface-container p-4 md:p-6 rounded-lg mb-12 shadow-sm">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3" id="stepperNav">
<!-- Step 1 -->
<div class="step-indicator flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-sm" data-step="1">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">1</div>
<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary-container leading-tight">Étape 1</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold">Motif &amp; Expertise</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Step 2 -->
<div class="step-indicator flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant transition-colors" data-step="2">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-variant text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">2</div>
<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider opacity-70 leading-tight">Étape 2</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold">Format &amp; Antenne</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Step 3 -->
<div class="step-indicator flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant transition-colors" data-step="3">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-variant text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">3</div>
<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider opacity-70 leading-tight">Étape 3</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold">Créneau &amp; Expert</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Step 4 -->
<div class="step-indicator flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant transition-colors" data-step="4">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-variant text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">4</div>
<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider opacity-70 leading-tight">Étape 4</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold">Cadrage &amp; Contact</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- FORMULAIRE COEUR -->
<form class="flex flex-col gap-16" id="bookingForm" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); window.validateAndConfirmBooking();">
<!-- ÉTAPE 1 : MOTIF ET TYPOLOGIE D'ACCOMPAGNEMENT -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 md:p-10 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-8" id="sectionStep1">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-bold">Étape 1 sur 4</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary-container font-bold mt-1">Sélectionnez le motif principal de votre démarche</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1">L'orientation vers le binôme d'experts le plus qualifié dépend de la nature technique de votre projet.</p>
</div>
<span class="text-xs bg-secondary-container text-primary font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full self-start md:self-auto">Choix obligatoire</span>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5" id="motifSelector">
<!-- Option 1 -->
<label class="relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/40 has-[:checked]:shadow-md">
<input checked="" class="sr-only" name="motif_rdv" type="radio" value="diagnostic_flash">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">domain_verification</span>
</div>
<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary checkmark-indicator">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">check</span>
</div>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] leading-6 font-bold text-primary-container mb-2">Diagnostic Flash Projet &amp; Aménagement</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Instruction amont de dossiers PLU/ZAC, permis d'aménager, application de la doctrine ERC (Éviter-Réduire-Compenser) et anticipation des espèces protégées.
              </p>
<div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">psychology</span>
<span>Référent : Ingénieur aménagement durable</span>
</div>
</label>
<!-- Option 2 -->
<label class="relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/40 has-[:checked]:shadow-md">
<input class="sr-only" name="motif_rdv" type="radio" value="trames_ecologiques">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">nature</span>
</div>
<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary checkmark-indicator">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">check</span>
</div>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] leading-6 font-bold text-primary-container mb-2">Trame Verte, Bleue &amp; Noire</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Continuités écologiques de ravines, préservation des corridors pour pétrels (éclairage sobre, trame sombre) et corridors faune de mi-pente.
              </p>
<div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">psychology</span>
<span>Référent : Écologue paysagiste &amp; avifaune</span>
</div>
</label>
<!-- Option 3 -->
<label class="relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/40 has-[:checked]:shadow-md">
<input class="sr-only" name="motif_rdv" type="radio" value="vegetalisation_indigene">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">local_florist</span>
</div>
<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary checkmark-indicator">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">check</span>
</div>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] leading-6 font-bold text-primary-container mb-2">Végétalisation Indigène &amp; Espèces Invasives</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Palette végétale spécifique à La Réunion (Label Végétal Péi), protocole d'éradication des EEE (Espèces Exotiques Envahissantes) et semences patrimoniales.
              </p>
<div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">psychology</span>
<span>Référent : Botaniste spécialiste flore mascareigne</span>
</div>
</label>
<!-- Option 4 -->
<label class="relative flex flex-col p-6 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/40 has-[:checked]:shadow-md">
<input class="sr-only" name="motif_rdv" type="radio" value="financements_subventions">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-tertiary-fixed text-tertiary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">savings</span>
</div>
<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary checkmark-indicator">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">check</span>
</div>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] leading-6 font-bold text-primary-container mb-2">Financements &amp; Subventions Région / Europe</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Montage financier, éligibilité aux appels à projets FEDER Biodiversité, label Territoire Engagé pour la Nature (TEN) et fonds de renaturation.
              </p>
<div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">psychology</span>
<span>Référent : Chargé de mission ingénierie financière</span>
</div>
</label>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ÉTAPE 2 : CHOIX DU LIEU OU FORMAT -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 md:p-10 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-8" id="sectionStep2">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-bold">Étape 2 sur 4</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary-container font-bold mt-1">Déterminez le format ou l'antenne d'accueil</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Nos spécialistes vous reçoivent physiquement aux 4 points cardinaux de l'île ou en téléconsultation directe.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4" id="locationSelector">
<!-- Visioconférence -->
<label class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/50">
<input checked="" class="sr-only" name="lieu_rdv" type="radio" value="visio">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">videocam</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-1">Visioconférence</span>
<span class="text-xs text-secondary font-semibold">100% Dématérialisé</span>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Lien sécurisé Tixeo / Webex envoyé dans votre invitation.</p>
</label>
<!-- Antenne Ouest -->
<label class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/50">
<input class="sr-only" name="lieu_rdv" type="radio" value="ouest_stpaul">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">location_on</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-1">Antenne Ouest</span>
<span class="text-xs text-secondary font-semibold">Saint-Paul (Cambaie)</span>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Focus : Récifs coralliens, savanes &amp; zones humides littorales.</p>
</label>
<!-- Siège Nord -->
<label class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/50">
<input class="sr-only" name="lieu_rdv" type="radio" value="nord_stemarie">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">corporate_fare</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-1">Siège Nord</span>
<span class="text-xs text-secondary font-semibold">Sainte-Marie (La Mare)</span>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Focus : SIG Borbonica, Observatoire &amp; direction générale.</p>
</label>
<!-- Antenne Sud -->
<label class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/50">
<input class="sr-only" name="lieu_rdv" type="radio" value="sud_stpierre">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">location_on</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-1">Antenne Sud</span>
<span class="text-xs text-secondary font-semibold">Saint-Pierre (Bassin Plat)</span>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Focus : Pétrels, trame sombre &amp; massifs volcaniques.</p>
</label>
<!-- Antenne Est -->
<label class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest cursor-pointer transition-all hover:shadow-md has-[:checked]:bg-secondary-container/50">
<input class="sr-only" name="lieu_rdv" type="radio" value="est_stbenoit">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">location_on</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-1">Antenne Est</span>
<span class="text-xs text-secondary font-semibold">Saint-Benoît</span>
<p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Focus : Forêts humides, ravines &amp; biosécurité insulaire.</p>
</label>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ÉTAPE 3 : SÉLECTION DU CRÉNEAU & EXPERT RÉFÉRENT -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 md:p-10 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-8" id="sectionStep3">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-bold">Étape 3 sur 4</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary-container font-bold mt-1">Sélectionnez la date, l'horaire et votre référent</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Tous les créneaux affichés garantissent la disponibilité immédiate de l'ingénieur conseil référent.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
<!-- Profil Expert Assigné selon sélection -->
<div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">badge</span>
<span>Votre interlocuteur privilégié</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-secondary-container shrink-0">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="Portrait professionnel souriant d'un écologue et biologiste de La Réunion, lumière naturelle douce en extérieur, fond feuillage endémique tropical flou, style photo éditoriale et institutionnelle" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBJCpZJBqycPjzdjLvAK2ybTFgcObqkFmtpE12mS0Uldc6sNplVbVVfmcaRnefbffYyB1M-iIpK0vN91xKGNhJuff-XsmxTgUepBJx_LOkkfO_sb-sxf4J84UloU86txRAh5pAGwEDBtZWWL8bD5rQNuJa1jV7VdtiG8MEQiQxC88bLwrveqrOgmQzIpKZYsRdulkzRjMMOafPKNiQlxK4x3M-adUO6CsVbbbZbFcIG">
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] font-bold text-on-surface">Dr. Mathieu Rivière</h3>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">Écologue en chef • Pôle Ouest &amp; Ravines</span>
</div>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                  « Docteur en écologie végétale tropicale, j'accompagne depuis 12 ans les maîtres d'ouvrages et bureaux d'études de l'île pour adapter leurs projets aux équilibres biologiques fragiles de notre territoire insulaire. »
